; engine-constants-band.fk — the constants engine.fk CARRIES are the constants
; the loader's rows RENDER, byte for byte, and a spot-read of each kind answers.
;
; engine.fk holds 82 generated zero-arg getters between exact markers because
; fkwu resolves every call site at compile time and a runtime walk installs
; names too late for it. The rows in form-ontology-loader.fk stay the one
; authority; this band folds carried == rendered so the copy cannot drift
; silently — the header-was-a-second-weaker-band lesson, given a bit.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk form-stdlib/engine-constants.fk form-stdlib/engine.fk
;
; Verdict 15 when every claim lands:
;   1  engine.fk carries the open marker exactly once
;   2  the carried block equals fol-engine-constants-text byte for byte
;   4  a string-row getter answers its row value (bmf-locale-en-us -> "en-US")
;   8  a factory-row getter's node carries exactly one child (bmf-domain-python)
;
; Bit 8 first asked (nil? ...) and fell: fkwu's len on a NON-list answers 0, so
; nil? is true there for strings, ints and nodes alike, while core.fk's own
; comment at :232 documents (nil? "a") as 0. That divergence is real, witnessed
; 2026-08-17, and is not this band's to settle — the bit now counts the node's
; children, a list on every arm.
(do
    (let etext (read_file "form-stdlib/engine.fk"))
    (let open-mark (fol-engine-constants-open))
    (let a (str_find etext open-mark 0))
    (let b (str_find etext (fol-engine-constants-close) 0))
    (let carried (substring etext a (add b (str_len (fol-engine-constants-close)))))
    (let c0 (if (and (ge a 0) (lt (str_find etext open-mark (add a 1)) 0)) 1 0))
    (let c1 (if (str_eq carried (fol-engine-constants-text)) 2 0))
    (let c2 (if (str_eq (bmf-locale-en-us) "en-US") 4 0))
    (let c3 (if (eq (len (node_children (bmf-domain-python))) 1) 8 0))
    (add c0 (add c1 (add c2 c3))))
